<title>USA: Walnut Creek PFFA, Calif., won by BancAmerica.</title>
<headline>Walnut Creek PFFA, Calif., won by BancAmerica.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancAmerica said it won $2.500 million of Walnut Creek Public Facilities Financing Auth., Calif., 1997 lease revenue bonds, with a true interest cost of  5.100  percent.</p>
</text>
